      fix(c): add Semgrep grammar augmentation (was empty)
      
      The Semgrep C grammar augmentation in
      lang/semgrep-grammars/src/semgrep-c/grammar.js was a no-op (rules block
      fully commented out), so any pattern using `...` outside a variadic
      parameter list, deep ellipsis, ellipsis-metavariable, or parenthesized
      typed metavariable failed to parse. Mirrors the C++ augmentation:
      adds semgrep_ellipsis / deep_ellipsis / semgrep_named_ellipsis /
      semgrep_metavar / semgrep_typed_metavar and wires them into _expression,
      _block_item, _top_level_item, _field_declaration_list_item,
      _field_identifier, parenthesized_expression, plus a __SEMGREP_EXPRESSION
      entry point. Includes 16 corpus tests covering each pattern category.
      
      Fixes LANG-471, LANG-473.
      
